%% ============================================================================
%% EML Model — Education Management System
%%
%% A fee-charging secondary school, modelled end to end: nineteen entities, the
%% five lifecycles the school actually runs on, the admission decision it takes
%% by judgement today, the capacity and overpayment refusals that must act, and
%% the two sagas that turn an accepted application into an enrolled, invoiced
%% student and a payment into a settled invoice.
%%
%% Built through the interactive authoring protocol in llmdetailed.txt §10, so
%% it holds that section's standard: help text on every entity and every column,
%% one %%rbac read rule per entity, every state backed by a declared %%enum, and
%% reports for every role on the matrix. Every diagram is valid, renderable
%% Mermaid.
%% ============================================================================

